# Sorcerous Spyglass affects cards regardless of the zone they are in (ruling 2021-03-19; CR 602.5): Bot1 looks at Bot2's hand as the
# Spyglass enters and names Miscalculation, so Bot2 can't activate its cycling from the hand, though it has the three Moxen to pay
# {2} (the refusal). The positive control is Footfall Crater, an unnamed card with cycling {1}, cycled right after: Bot2 draws.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sorcerous Spyglass
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Miscalculation
Footfall Crater
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island
Island
Island x10

